# head/adult/woman/nose_straight: a straight nose: a fine bridge shadow over the tip; in profile a straight line
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role nose straight
layer face
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -8 -10
|s
|r

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -14 -9
|s
|sq

view L key rest origin 0 -9
|.t
|qs

# (P2b FACES) elven fineness: thinner, swept-up brows and a finer nose for elves (when elf replace)
view D key rest origin -7 -10 when elf replace
|t.
|.r
